{
  "about": "One site per ratchet entry with no bead of its own in a family with no family bead and not standing, named by its family; a count family above 0 is one site; budgets, floors, the schema and a family with a family bead or standing give none; a family naming both is refused (canopi-f47t.52.257, 2.1-M78)",
